  'crit_rating': 'GeM seller rating 3.5 se upar',
  'nav_faq': 'FAQs',
  'faq_h': 'Aksar poochhe jaane wale sawal',
  'faq_lead': 'Eligibility, cost, bond issue hone aur cancellation se jude aam sawal, GeM portal par use hone wali terms mein.',
  'faq_q1': 'Bid participation page par \'Surety Bond\' aur \'Apply for Bond\' options kya hain?',
  'faq_a1': 'GeM chuni hui tenders mein sellers ko EMD ke roop mein Insurance Surety Bond submit karne ki anumati deta hai. \'Apply for Bond\' select karne par Insurance Surety Bond ka application page khulta hai, jahan is instrument, eligibility conditions aur application procedure ka vivaran diya gaya hai.',
  'faq_q2': 'Insurance Surety Bond kya hai?',
  'faq_a2': 'Insurance Surety Bond IRDAI-registered insurance company dwara issue kiya jata hai aur ise tender mein Earnest Money Deposit (EMD) ke roop mein submit kiya ja sakta hai. Yeh bank guarantee ka collateral-free vikalp hai. Yeh buyer ko aashwast karta hai ki seller apni bid mein liye gaye obligations poore karega, aur iske liye seller ko collateral girvi rakhne, cash block karne ya bank fund limit istemal karne ki zaroorat nahi hoti.',
  'faq_q3': 'Insurance Surety Bond ki zaroorat kyon hai?',
  'faq_a3': 'GeM par kuch tenders mein seller ko bid security ya performance security ke roop mein Earnest Money Deposit dena hota hai, jiske liye aam taur par bank guarantee li jaati hai. Bank mein paisa block karne ke bajay seller Insurance Surety Bond submit kar sakta hai.',
  'faq_q4': 'Kya Insurance Surety Bond kanooni roop se valid hai aur GeM par accept hota hai?',
  'faq_a4': 'Haan. Insurance Surety Bonds government approved aur IRDAI authorised hain, aur tender conditions ke adheen GeM ki tenders mein valid EMD instrument ke roop mein swikar kiye jaate hain. GeM ki General Terms and Conditions EMD ke liye inke upyog ki anumati deti hain. Kisi vishesh tender mein acceptance tender document mein likhi hoti hai, jise har case mein dekhna chahiye.',
  'faq_q5': 'Insurance Surety Bond bank guarantee se kaise alag hai?',
  'faq_a5': 'Bank guarantee bank dwara buyer ko diya gaya vachan hai, jo seller ki apni capital par secured hota hai. Insurance Surety Bond insurance company dwara buyer ko issue ki gayi guarantee hai, jisme cash ya bank limit block nahi hoti aur jo business, uske performance record aur financials ke assessment par aadharit hoti hai. Bank guarantee issue karne ke liye commission leta hai; insurer bond issue karne ke liye premium leta hai.',
  'faq_q6': 'Kaise pata chalega ki koi tender Insurance Surety Bond accept karta hai?',
  'faq_a6': 'Jahan tender EMD ke roop mein Insurance Surety Bond accept karta hai, wahan yeh tender document ke EMD clause mein spasht roop se likha hota hai.',
  'faq_q7': 'Apply karne ke liye kaun eligible hai?',
  'faq_a7': 'Insurer ki terms and conditions ke adheen, kam se kam teen saal ka operational track record, sthir financial sthiti aur relevant project experience rakhne wala business eligible ho sakta hai. Sabhi tarah ke businesses apply kar sakte hain: public limited aur private limited companies, partnership firms, LLPs aur proprietorships.',
  'faq_q8': 'Application ki procedure kya hai?',
  'faq_a8': 'Bid participation journey ke EMD ya ePBG charan par do options dikhte hain: \'In Form of Surety Bond\' aur \'In Form of Bank Guarantee\'. \'In Form of Surety Bond\' choose karein, phir mode ke roop mein \'Online\' choose karein aur \'Apply for Bond\' ke through aage badhein. GeM pehle bid details application page ke saath share karne ki consent leta hai, aur phir redirection ki consent leta hai. Application page par KYC aur bid details pehle se bhare hote hain; inhein validate karke OTP se confirm kiya jata hai, jiske baad baaki steps mein guidance milti hai. Bond GeM par upload hone ke baad tender process aage badhti hai aur status GeM par hi track kiya ja sakta hai.',
  'faq_q9': 'Application assess karne ke liye insurer ko kaun si jaankari chahiye hoti hai?',
  'faq_a9': 'Adhiktar cases mein insurer nimnlikhit maangta hai.',
  'faq_a9_1': 'Company aur uske directors, proprietor ya partners ka vivaran',
  'faq_a9_2': 'Pichhle teen financial years ke audited financial statements',
  'faq_a9_3': 'Chaalu financial year ke certified financial statements',
  'faq_a9_4': 'Certified external agency ki credit rating report, agar uplabdh ho',
  'faq_a9_5': 'Company, proprietor ya partners ki credit bureau report (CIBIL, CRIF, Experian ya Equifax)',
  'faq_a9_6': 'Business ki GST filing details (optional)',
  'faq_a9_note': 'Yeh list indicative hai. Applicant ke anusar insurer aur jaankari maang sakte hain.',
  'faq_q10': 'Kya collateral dena zaroori hai?',
  'faq_a10': 'Insurance Surety Bond ke liye collateral zaroori nahi hai. Insurer ke risk assessment ke aadhar par kuch cases mein EMD value ke percentage ke roop mein lien-marked fixed deposit ya margin money maangi ja sakti hai.',
  'faq_q11': 'Process mein kitna samay lagta hai?',
  'faq_a11': 'Application page par details submit karne ke 24 ghante ke andar eligibility tay ki ja sakti hai. Details aur consent poore hone ke baad, adhiktar cases mein IRDAI-licensed insurer 48 ghante ke andar bond issue kar sakta hai. Zyada value ke bonds mein risk assessment poora hone tak thoda adhik samay lag sakta hai.',
  'faq_q12': 'Issue hone ke baad bond kaise milta hai?',
  'faq_a12': 'Bank guarantee ki tarah, Insurance Surety Bond insurance company dwara issue kiya jata hai aur seller ko email se bheja jata hai. Jahan ise \'Apply for Bond\' route se liya jata hai, wahan bond document seedhe GeM par tender bid mein upload ho jata hai.',
  'faq_q13': 'Insurers kitna premium lete hain?',
  'faq_a13': 'Premium har case mein alag hota hai. Insurer ke risk assessment ke aadhar par yeh aam taur par bond value ka lagbhag 0.5 se 5 pratishat prati varsh ki range mein ho sakta hai. Kuch insurers assessed risk se alag ek minimum premium lagate hain. Premium ke alawa, indemnity agreement aur bond issuance par lagne wala stamp duty aur mamuli processing fees seller vahan karta hai.',
  'faq_q14': 'Kya bond cancel kiya ja sakta hai?',
  'faq_a14': 'Issue ho chuke bond ko sirf tab cancel kiya ja sakta hai jab beneficiary tender cancel kare, jiske liye use kaaran sahit letter jaari karna hota hai. Ek baar bhara gaya stamp duty wapas nahi hota. Premium ki wapsi har insurer ke cancellation aur refund guidelines ke adheen hoti hai. Agar seller bid se hat jata hai to bond void ho jata hai aur premium wapas nahi hota.',
  'faq_q15': 'Agar bond mein amendment zaroori ho to?',
